# Tenuous Existence (abyssea 170), the reply kind: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its story
# quests before it and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie). Prog 1 (a GM). Joachim: 336,
# finished: completed, Champions of Abyssea accepted. Champions of Abyssea back to available and the quest back to
# accepted at Prog 1 (GMs): Joachim again: 336 again. Joachim has his own onTrigger (xi.abyssea.traverserNPCOnTrigger):
# an Event-rank 336 would alternate with it (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback) and the second talk would go to his
# script (his 328: Dawn of Death accepted or completed).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/336
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed
quest Abyssea.FirstContact completed
quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate completed
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness completed
quest Abyssea.TenuousExistence accepted
quest Abyssea.HeroesOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.ScarsOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.TheForbiddenFrontier completed
login
charvar Quest[8][170]Prog 1             # a GM: Prog 1
trigger Joachim                         # 336
finish                                  # completed; Champions of Abyssea accepted
quest Abyssea.ChampionsOfAbyssea available # a GM
quest Abyssea.TenuousExistence available # a GM
quest Abyssea.TenuousExistence accepted # a GM
charvar Quest[8][170]Prog 1             # a GM: Prog 1
trigger Joachim                         # 336 again (the kind)
finish                                  # completed again
